Dialogue: 0,0:00:04.65,0:00:09.05,Default,,0,0,0,,YAMU, YAMU, YAMU, YAMU, YAMU!
Dialogue: 0,0:00:30.47,0:00:31.59,Default,,0,0,0,,You're on the move!
Dialogue: 0,0:01:04.73,0:01:09.81,Default,,0,0,0,,There better be a bathroom in that palace.\NLet's focus on getting in first. Did you
Dialogue: 0,0:01:09.89,0:01:13.57,Default,,0,0,0,,forget what happened last time how was i\Nsupposed to know we couldn't walk through
Dialogue: 0,0:01:13.65,0:01:16.95,Default,,0,0,0,,doors hold on guys maybe this time we
Dialogue: 0,0:01:17.03,0:01:20.73,Default,,0,0,0,,can pharaoh i know why we were sent here
Dialogue: 0,0:01:20.81,0:01:25.35,Default,,0,0,0,,We have to find out what your name is\Nin order to beat Bakura at his own game.
Dialogue: 0,0:01:25.43,0:01:27.33,Default,,0,0,0,,Now, please, let us in.
Dialogue: 0,0:01:30.35,0:01:31.31,Default,,0,0,0,,It worked!
Dialogue: 0,0:01:31.55,0:01:34.09,Default,,0,0,0,,We can go through! It worked! What?
Dialogue: 0,0:01:34.79,0:01:35.75,Default,,0,0,0,,You sure?
Dialogue: 0,0:01:36.15,0:01:37.57,Default,,0,0,0,,Oh, happy day!
Dialogue: 0,0:01:37.89,0:01:40.49,Default,,0,0,0,,This place is known for\Nits delectable food.
Dialogue: 0,0:01:41.13,0:01:44.37,Default,,0,0,0,,Bopas is going to eat a\Nfive-course meal. Come on!
Dialogue: 0,0:01:44.61,0:01:47.45,Default,,0,0,0,,Let's get in there and start\Nhunting for clues, Cal!
Dialogue: 0,0:01:47.53,0:01:48.36,Default,,0,0,0,,Yeah!
Dialogue: 0,0:01:50.49,0:01:52.49,Default,,0,0,0,,Childless pork chops, here I come!
Dialogue: 0,0:02:01.45,0:02:03.09,Default,,0,0,0,,This is some crit.
Dialogue: 0,0:02:03.43,0:02:05.73,Default,,0,0,0,,It's good to be the king. Focus, Joey.
Dialogue: 0,0:02:06.01,0:02:07.30,Default,,0,0,0,,We have to find clues.
Dialogue: 0,0:02:07.51,0:02:08.95,Default,,0,0,0,,Bobasa will check the kitchen.
Dialogue: 0,0:02:09.03,0:02:10.97,Default,,0,0,0,,Let's meet back here in one hour.
Dialogue: 0,0:02:11.23,0:02:12.31,Default,,0,0,0,,Good call, Yuge.
Dialogue: 0,0:02:20.03,0:02:21.67,Default,,0,0,0,,This is not over.
Dialogue: 0,0:02:21.75,0:02:24.23,Default,,0,0,0,,Your empire shall crumble, Pharaoh.
Dialogue: 0,0:02:24.31,0:02:28.97,Default,,0,0,0,,Your millennium items will be mine,\Nand Zork the Dark One will return.
Dialogue: 0,0:02:29.05,0:02:30.29,Default,,0,0,0,,Mark my words.
Dialogue: 0,0:02:31.51,0:02:33.69,Default,,0,0,0,,I'm afraid it's all over, Bakura.
Dialogue: 0,0:02:33.97,0:02:36.97,Default,,0,0,0,,Your plans for destruction\Nwill never come to pass.
Dialogue: 0,0:02:37.33,0:02:40.11,Default,,0,0,0,,So let it be written, so let it be done.
Dialogue: 0,0:02:40.53,0:02:43.35,Default,,0,0,0,,The land of Egypt shall\Nonce again know peace.
Dialogue: 0,0:02:45.59,0:02:46.42,Default,,0,0,0,,Never.
Dialogue: 0,0:02:50.55,0:02:51.47,Default,,0,0,0,,That's enough.
Dialogue: 0,0:02:51.81,0:02:53.73,Default,,0,0,0,,Now return those items to me.
Dialogue: 0,0:02:53.97,0:02:56.51,Default,,0,0,0,,Those items will stay\Nright where they are.
Dialogue: 0,0:02:57.71,0:03:00.07,Default,,0,0,0,,Akhnad, what is the meaning of this?
Dialogue: 0,0:03:01.85,0:03:02.68,Default,,0,0,0,,Pharaoh,
Dialogue: 0,0:03:02.83,0:03:07.29,Default,,0,0,0,,I am responsible for the creation of\Nthe items and I shall decide their fate.
Dialogue: 0,0:03:07.37,0:03:08.20,Default,,0,0,0,,Oh, no.
Dialogue: 0,0:03:11.01,0:03:12.47,Default,,0,0,0,,He holds the key.
Dialogue: 0,0:03:13.19,0:03:15.31,Default,,0,0,0,,That item belongs to Shadda.
Dialogue: 0,0:03:15.71,0:03:17.03,Default,,0,0,0,,What have you done with him?
Dialogue: 0,0:03:17.11,0:03:21.71,Default,,0,0,0,,What's important is that his Millennium\NItem will be put to good use,
Dialogue: 0,0:03:21.99,0:03:23.35,Default,,0,0,0,,as will all of yours.
Dialogue: 0,0:03:23.63,0:03:24.93,Default,,0,0,0,,You've lost your mind!
Dialogue: 0,0:03:27.35,0:03:28.59,Default,,0,0,0,,Look at Valkyra!
Dialogue: 0,0:03:34.49,0:03:35.93,Default,,0,0,0,,Where am I?
Dialogue: 0,0:03:36.01,0:03:38.71,Default,,0,0,0,,Who are you? Tell me! My hands!
Dialogue: 0,0:03:39.17,0:03:40.69,Default,,0,0,0,,What's happening to me?
Dialogue: 0,0:03:43.33,0:03:46.23,Default,,0,0,0,,I was just using that fool as my pawn!
Dialogue: 0,0:03:47.37,0:03:48.69,Default,,0,0,0,,Who are you?
Dialogue: 0,0:03:49.13,0:03:50.85,Default,,0,0,0,,The shadows are taking me!
Dialogue: 0,0:03:51.19,0:03:52.55,Default,,0,0,0,,Someone help me!
Dialogue: 0,0:03:56.65,0:03:57.83,Default,,0,0,0,,He's gone!
Dialogue: 0,0:03:58.97,0:04:02.93,Default,,0,0,0,,It's time you learned the true\Nnature of this shadow game!
Dialogue: 0,0:04:03.97,0:04:05.31,Default,,0,0,0,,Explain yourself!
Dialogue: 0,0:04:07.43,0:04:08.26,Default,,0,0,0,,Pharaoh!
Dialogue: 0,0:04:08.39,0:04:09.91,Default,,0,0,0,,You must stop him!
Dialogue: 0,0:04:10.53,0:04:11.36,Default,,0,0,0,,Shaddaa!
Dialogue: 0,0:04:17.11,0:04:17.99,Default,,0,0,0,,Oh, here we go.
Dialogue: 0,0:04:18.31,0:04:19.60,Default,,0,0,0,,This could be a start.
Dialogue: 0,0:04:19.83,0:04:22.83,Default,,0,0,0,,Maybe the Pharaoh's name\Nis somewhere on this wall.
Dialogue: 0,0:04:23.69,0:04:27.93,Default,,0,0,0,,Of course, it would help if I could\Nactually read ancient hieroglyphics.
Dialogue: 0,0:04:33.79,0:04:34.95,Default,,0,0,0,,Excuse me, ma 'am.
Dialogue: 0,0:04:35.13,0:04:36.03,Default,,0,0,0,,Can I ask you a question?
Dialogue: 0,0:04:36.11,0:04:36.94,Default,,0,0,0,,Hello?
Dialogue: 0,0:04:40.21,0:04:41.29,Default,,0,0,0,,Oh, not again.
Dialogue: 0,0:04:41.37,0:04:42.37,Default,,0,0,0,,That's not cool.
Dialogue: 0,0:04:42.67,0:04:45.08,Default,,0,0,0,,These people treat me like I don't exist.
Dialogue: 0,0:04:46.27,0:04:48.81,Default,,0,0,0,,I may have just hit the jackpot.
Dialogue: 0,0:04:49.31,0:04:51.97,Default,,0,0,0,,It's like the palace library or something.
Dialogue: 0,0:04:52.49,0:04:55.23,Default,,0,0,0,,Oh, this is just great.
Dialogue: 0,0:04:57.55,0:04:59.59,Default,,0,0,0,,We'll never find that name.
Dialogue: 0,0:05:02.59,0:05:04.57,Default,,0,0,0,,Searching for clues.
Dialogue: 0,0:05:05.21,0:05:06.65,Default,,0,0,0,,Never tasted it.
Dialogue: 0,0:05:07.01,0:05:07.97,Default,,0,0,0,,So good.
Dialogue: 0,0:05:09.65,0:05:11.57,Default,,0,0,0,,That's right, my young friend.
Dialogue: 0,0:05:12.05,0:05:13.37,Default,,0,0,0,,Find me that name.
Dialogue: 0,0:05:14.49,0:05:15.45,Default,,0,0,0,,He he he he he!
Dialogue: 0,0:05:16.41,0:05:17.24,Default,,0,0,0,,Shadda!
Dialogue: 0,0:05:17.49,0:05:18.63,Default,,0,0,0,,Careful, Pharaoh!
Dialogue: 0,0:05:19.41,0:05:20.83,Default,,0,0,0,,Aknadin is a traitor!
Dialogue: 0,0:05:21.33,0:05:24.13,Default,,0,0,0,,Now give me back my Millennium Key!
Dialogue: 0,0:05:25.57,0:05:26.73,Default,,0,0,0,,Release me!
Dialogue: 0,0:05:27.55,0:05:28.38,Default,,0,0,0,,Shadow!
Dialogue: 0,0:05:28.57,0:05:29.71,Default,,0,0,0,,Anyone else?
Dialogue: 0,0:05:30.47,0:05:32.91,Default,,0,0,0,,Aknadin, what is the meaning of all this?
Dialogue: 0,0:05:33.33,0:05:34.53,Default,,0,0,0,,Have you gone mad?
Dialogue: 0,0:05:34.73,0:05:38.55,Default,,0,0,0,,I don't know who's controlling\Nyour mind, but this ends now!
Dialogue: 0,0:05:38.87,0:05:40.97,Default,,0,0,0,,A new king shall soon rise!
Dialogue: 0,0:05:41.05,0:05:42.51,Default,,0,0,0,,Hold your tongue!
Dialogue: 0,0:05:42.89,0:05:45.25,Default,,0,0,0,,How dare you utter such venomous words,
Dialogue: 0,0:05:45.43,0:05:48.31,Default,,0,0,0,,and in the presence of\Nthe great pharaoh no less!
Dialogue: 0,0:05:48.69,0:05:49.52,Default,,0,0,0,,Silence!
Dialogue: 0,0:05:51.19,0:05:52.02,Default,,0,0,0,,No!
Dialogue: 0,0:05:52.10,0:05:53.40,Default,,0,0,0,,What have you done to him?
Dialogue: 0,0:05:54.19,0:05:55.55,Default,,0,0,0,,Sato can't move!
Dialogue: 0,0:05:55.89,0:05:57.37,Default,,0,0,0,,It's almost like he's...
Dialogue: 0,0:05:57.45,0:05:59.43,Default,,0,0,0,,Frozen in time? Why, yes!
Dialogue: 0,0:05:59.89,0:06:01.23,Default,,0,0,0,,Just like this!
Dialogue: 0,0:06:03.57,0:06:05.77,Default,,0,0,0,,That ought to hold you for a while.
Dialogue: 0,0:06:05.85,0:06:09.71,Default,,0,0,0,,At least long enough for me to\Ncomplete what Bakura couldn't.
Dialogue: 0,0:06:13.79,0:06:15.09,Default,,0,0,0,,I've done it!
Dialogue: 0,0:06:15.29,0:06:19.58,Default,,0,0,0,,As soon as I place the seven items in\Nthe stone, the Dark One shall rise!
Dialogue: 0,0:06:19.71,0:06:22.79,Default,,0,0,0,,And together we shall usher in a new age!
Dialogue: 0,0:06:23.21,0:06:25.47,Default,,0,0,0,,And your empire shall crumble.
Dialogue: 0,0:06:26.45,0:06:29.27,Default,,0,0,0,,It all comes full circle, doesn't it?
Dialogue: 0,0:06:29.43,0:06:32.96,Default,,0,0,0,,For now I shall return the seven\Ntreasures whence they came.
Dialogue: 0,0:06:33.73,0:06:36.05,Default,,0,0,0,,This necklace is number six.
Dialogue: 0,0:06:36.83,0:06:39.59,Default,,0,0,0,,And now, the final piece!
Dialogue: 0,0:06:39.67,0:06:41.55,Default,,0,0,0,,Release my Millennium Eye!
Dialogue: 0,0:06:45.73,0:06:48.75,Default,,0,0,0,,Now to finish what I began years ago!
Dialogue: 0,0:06:49.47,0:06:50.30,Default,,0,0,0,,That's right!
Dialogue: 0,0:06:50.53,0:06:53.77,Default,,0,0,0,,Restore the Seven Treasures\Nto their resting place!
Dialogue: 0,0:06:54.25,0:06:58.43,Default,,0,0,0,,I thought Bakuro was defeated, but\Nthen how can I be hearing his voice?
Dialogue: 0,0:06:59.77,0:07:02.30,Default,,0,0,0,,You've proven yourself\Nto be a worthy pawn!
Dialogue: 0,0:07:02.99,0:07:08.01,Default,,0,0,0,,Now complete your task, and my ultimate\Nshadow game shall be nearly complete!
Dialogue: 0,0:07:12.73,0:07:16.83,Default,,0,0,0,,I saw Bakura disappear into\Nthe shadows with my own eyes.
Dialogue: 0,0:07:20.21,0:07:23.13,Default,,0,0,0,,His so-called shadow game should be over.
Dialogue: 0,0:07:23.39,0:07:25.05,Default,,0,0,0,,Wait, unless...
Dialogue: 0,0:07:25.13,0:07:26.63,Default,,0,0,0,,The final piece.
Dialogue: 0,0:07:30.03,0:07:32.29,Default,,0,0,0,,Is this all just a game?
Dialogue: 0,0:07:40.29,0:07:45.03,Default,,0,0,0,,Leave it to you to sleep through the most\Nimportant game of your life, Pharaoh.
Dialogue: 0,0:07:45.63,0:07:47.77,Default,,0,0,0,,Where are we? Tell me!
Dialogue: 0,0:07:48.21,0:07:52.83,Default,,0,0,0,,Why, we're in the Shadow Realm, of\Ncourse, sitting before the playing field.
Dialogue: 0,0:07:53.57,0:07:56.65,Default,,0,0,0,,After all, I promised you\Na Shadow Game, didn't I?
Dialogue: 0,0:07:56.85,0:07:58.77,Default,,0,0,0,,I always trooped my word.
Dialogue: 0,0:07:59.05,0:08:02.03,Default,,0,0,0,,I'm in no mood for games! Too late.
Dialogue: 0,0:08:02.37,0:08:05.02,Default,,0,0,0,,I'm afraid you're right\Nin the middle of one.
Dialogue: 0,0:08:05.21,0:08:07.71,Default,,0,0,0,,The field is the world of ancient Egypt.
Dialogue: 0,0:08:07.79,0:08:10.61,Default,,0,0,0,,The pawns are the people of your past.
Dialogue: 0,0:08:10.95,0:08:15.87,Default,,0,0,0,,Are you saying that everything we do\Naffects the events of the past? Are you?
Dialogue: 0,0:08:16.07,0:08:20.31,Default,,0,0,0,,Just when I think you can't sink any\Nlower, you proved me wrong, Pakura.
Dialogue: 0,0:08:20.79,0:08:25.26,Default,,0,0,0,,Manipulating the lives of others just\Nso you can play out some twisted game?
Dialogue: 0,0:08:26.05,0:08:28.11,Default,,0,0,0,,Not some game, the game.
Dialogue: 0,0:08:28.81,0:08:32.11,Default,,0,0,0,,And as soon as I resurrect\NZork from the Millennium Stu,
Dialogue: 0,0:08:32.39,0:08:34.79,Default,,0,0,0,,the final stage of this game will begin.
Dialogue: 0,0:08:37.95,0:08:42.71,Default,,0,0,0,,Wait, so if I don't defeat Sork,\Nthat means I lose the game?
Dialogue: 0,0:08:42.97,0:08:45.65,Default,,0,0,0,,You'll lose much more\Nthan that. Like what?
Dialogue: 0,0:08:46.09,0:08:48.69,Default,,0,0,0,,Like those meddling\Ntwits you call friends.
Dialogue: 0,0:08:49.17,0:08:51.76,Default,,0,0,0,,They enter a world where\Nthey didn't belong.
Dialogue: 0,0:08:51.89,0:08:56.07,Default,,0,0,0,,So when the playing field disappears,\Nthey'll be trapped in the shadow.
Dialogue: 0,0:08:57.73,0:08:59.69,Default,,0,0,0,,You'll never see them again!
Dialogue: 0,0:09:02.85,0:09:06.75,Default,,0,0,0,,If you want to save your friends,\Nyou'll have to win the game.
Dialogue: 0,0:09:07.31,0:09:10.90,Default,,0,0,0,,However, at the moment, all of\Nyour pawns are frozen in time,
Dialogue: 0,0:09:11.09,0:09:13.81,Default,,0,0,0,,thanks to this handy device. What's that?
Dialogue: 0,0:09:14.45,0:09:17.17,Default,,0,0,0,,Why, it's my hourglass token, of course.
Dialogue: 0,0:09:17.81,0:09:20.45,Default,,0,0,0,,Your hourglass token? Exactly.
Dialogue: 0,0:09:20.83,0:09:23.61,Default,,0,0,0,,And as the game master,\NI possess three of them.
Dialogue: 0,0:09:23.69,0:09:27.81,Default,,0,0,0,,This one freezes time for every\Ncharacter in the game except for mine.
Dialogue: 0,0:09:28.47,0:09:30.43,Default,,0,0,0,,So you can manipulate time?
Dialogue: 0,0:09:31.05,0:09:31.91,Default,,0,0,0,,That's right.
Dialogue: 0,0:09:32.13,0:09:33.59,Default,,0,0,0,,And it's not the first time.
Dialogue: 0,0:09:33.67,0:09:34.87,Default,,0,0,0,,Observe.
Dialogue: 0,0:09:35.27,0:09:37.81,Default,,0,0,0,,I used this one earlier in the game.
Dialogue: 0,0:09:38.15,0:09:42.27,Default,,0,0,0,,Perhaps you recall a little incident\Nduring which time went in reverse?
Dialogue: 0,0:09:42.35,0:09:43.63,Default,,0,0,0,,Now you know how!
Dialogue: 0,0:10:00.67,0:10:02.11,Default,,0,0,0,,So that was you!
Dialogue: 0,0:10:02.19,0:10:06.45,Default,,0,0,0,,Guilty as charged. And he who\Ncontrols the hands of time.
Dialogue: 0,0:10:06.53,0:10:11.15,Default,,0,0,0,,Controls fate thanks to these hour\Nclasses, I can rewrite history.
Dialogue: 0,0:10:11.23,0:10:15.51,Default,,0,0,0,,and not only once but three\Ntimes over the course of the game
Dialogue: 0,0:10:15.59,0:10:20.93,Default,,0,0,0,,you know what that means right\Nyour life is under my control
Dialogue: 0,0:10:27.27,0:10:30.03,Default,,0,0,0,,something's not right\NI can't move a muscle
Dialogue: 0,0:10:33.59,0:10:35.18,Default,,0,0,0,,Vakura must be behind this.
Dialogue: 0,0:10:35.39,0:10:37.51,Default,,0,0,0,,I just hope the pharaoh's all right.
Dialogue: 0,0:10:39.23,0:10:42.11,Default,,0,0,0,,I could think of worse\Nsituations to be stuck in.
Dialogue: 0,0:10:43.45,0:10:45.25,Default,,0,0,0,,You're my pawn now.
Dialogue: 0,0:10:46.27,0:10:48.15,Default,,0,0,0,,So you're free to move about.
Dialogue: 0,0:10:48.69,0:10:51.95,Default,,0,0,0,,What puzzles me is why\Nthat buffoon is unaffected.
Dialogue: 0,0:10:53.95,0:10:55.05,Default,,0,0,0,,This is bad.
Dialogue: 0,0:10:55.31,0:10:57.57,Default,,0,0,0,,My belly is so big I\Ncan't see my slippers.
Dialogue: 0,0:10:57.65,0:11:00.21,Default,,0,0,0,,Master Zork, hear me!
Dialogue: 0,0:11:00.47,0:11:02.93,Default,,0,0,0,,I now offer you the seven treasures!
Dialogue: 0,0:11:03.87,0:11:08.55,Default,,0,0,0,,I sense the pulse of pure\Nevil beating below us.
Dialogue: 0,0:11:08.79,0:11:11.03,Default,,0,0,0,,The Dark One has awakened.
Dialogue: 0,0:11:12.65,0:11:18.15,Default,,0,0,0,,So, the mortal responsible for creating\Nthe Millennium Items has returned.
Dialogue: 0,0:11:18.73,0:11:23.31,Default,,0,0,0,,Now, denounce your allegiance to\NEgypt and pledge your loyalty to me.
Dialogue: 0,0:11:23.39,0:11:27.13,Default,,0,0,0,,Do this, and everything\Nyou desire shall be yours.
Dialogue: 0,0:11:27.67,0:11:31.01,Default,,0,0,0,,My only wish is for a\Nnew pharaoh to be named.
Dialogue: 0,0:11:31.91,0:11:35.09,Default,,0,0,0,,He shall be my own beloved son, Seto!
Dialogue: 0,0:11:36.67,0:11:39.41,Default,,0,0,0,,No, this cannot be true.
Dialogue: 0,0:11:40.29,0:11:42.87,Default,,0,0,0,,Master Arknadin is my father?
Dialogue: 0,0:11:43.91,0:11:45.33,Default,,0,0,0,,Very well.
Dialogue: 0,0:11:45.79,0:11:51.27,Default,,0,0,0,,Your transformation from Sacred Godhead\Nto Lord of Darkness is now complete.
Dialogue: 0,0:11:55.71,0:11:57.49,Default,,0,0,0,,No, Akhenaten!
Dialogue: 0,0:12:04.61,0:12:08.63,Default,,0,0,0,,My Akhenaten game piece has just\Ndoubled in overall strength.
Dialogue: 0,0:12:09.01,0:12:12.07,Default,,0,0,0,,I give you the great Shadow Magician.
Dialogue: 0,0:12:13.21,0:12:15.27,Default,,0,0,0,,What have you done to Akhenaten?
Dialogue: 0,0:12:15.75,0:12:17.27,Default,,0,0,0,,I haven't done a thing.
Dialogue: 0,0:12:17.65,0:12:22.35,Default,,0,0,0,,All of these events are reoccurring\Nexactly as they did 5,000 years ago.
Dialogue: 0,0:12:22.43,0:12:25.47,Default,,0,0,0,,With some small modifications, of course.
Dialogue: 0,0:12:25.77,0:12:30.17,Default,,0,0,0,,Thanks to this shadow game of mine,\NI'm able to influence certain events.
Dialogue: 0,0:12:30.67,0:12:31.87,Default,,0,0,0,,You see, Pharaoh,
Dialogue: 0,0:12:32.35,0:12:33.18,Default,,0,0,0,,in the old days,
Dialogue: 0,0:12:33.26,0:12:37.65,Default,,0,0,0,,you managed to lock away your own\Nspirit in order to seal Zork away.
Dialogue: 0,0:12:38.09,0:12:40.53,Default,,0,0,0,,But you won't be so lucky this time.
Dialogue: 0,0:12:40.73,0:12:43.09,Default,,0,0,0,,There are still some holes in your memory.
Dialogue: 0,0:12:43.17,0:12:46.79,Default,,0,0,0,,I mean, let's face it, Pharaoh,\Nyou don't even know your own name.
Dialogue: 0,0:12:46.87,0:12:51.83,Default,,0,0,0,,A single word with the power to both\Nresurrect Zork and lock him away.
Dialogue: 0,0:12:52.99,0:12:53.82,Default,,0,0,0,,However,
Dialogue: 0,0:12:53.93,0:12:57.41,Default,,0,0,0,,I discovered a way to bring back\Nthe Dark One without that word,
Dialogue: 0,0:12:57.49,0:12:58.99,Default,,0,0,0,,by simply using this,
Dialogue: 0,0:12:59.33,0:13:01.75,Default,,0,0,0,,my third and final hourglass.
Dialogue: 0,0:13:02.25,0:13:04.93,Default,,0,0,0,,Oh no, just what are you saying, Bakura?
Dialogue: 0,0:13:05.37,0:13:07.19,Default,,0,0,0,,Let me spell this out for you.
Dialogue: 0,0:13:07.43,0:13:12.29,Default,,0,0,0,,When the last grain of sand falls, the\Nruler of the darkest shadows shall arise.
Dialogue: 0,0:13:19.41,0:13:22.35,Default,,0,0,0,,The pharaoh's name should\Nbe located in this room.
Dialogue: 0,0:13:22.59,0:13:26.03,Default,,0,0,0,,Now find it before the\Nothers do and destroy it.
Dialogue: 0,0:13:27.47,0:13:30.37,Default,,0,0,0,,Every pharaoh in history\Nmust be listed here.
Dialogue: 0,0:13:30.51,0:13:35.16,Default,,0,0,0,,So the name I'm looking for has got to\Nbe written somewhere on the last tablet.
Dialogue: 0,0:13:35.41,0:13:36.24,Default,,0,0,0,,What?
Dialogue: 0,0:13:36.32,0:13:38.07,Default,,0,0,0,,This doesn't make any sense at all.
Dialogue: 0,0:13:39.05,0:13:41.77,Default,,0,0,0,,This stone tablet is completely blank!
Dialogue: 0,0:13:42.79,0:13:47.69,Default,,0,0,0,,Now, great Shadow Makers, banish\Nthe pharaoh to the darkness,
Dialogue: 0,0:13:48.03,0:13:50.29,Default,,0,0,0,,so that your son may take the throne.
Dialogue: 0,0:13:52.39,0:13:57.79,Default,,0,0,0,,This is what I have always wanted for you,\NShadow, ever since you were a young boy.
Dialogue: 0,0:13:58.67,0:14:02.59,Default,,0,0,0,,For your own protection, no one\Nmust ever know I have a family.
Dialogue: 0,0:14:04.11,0:14:07.95,Default,,0,0,0,,How could he leave me and then\Nlie to me all these years?
Dialogue: 0,0:14:08.61,0:14:11.37,Default,,0,0,0,,There's something else\Nyou should know, my son.
Dialogue: 0,0:14:11.45,0:14:14.45,Default,,0,0,0,,The former king Ahnam\NCannon was my brother.
Dialogue: 0,0:14:14.93,0:14:17.99,Default,,0,0,0,,That means should anything\Nhappen to the current pharaoh,
Dialogue: 0,0:14:18.07,0:14:20.60,Default,,0,0,0,,you are next in line\Nto inherit the throne.
Dialogue: 0,0:14:21.19,0:14:26.13,Default,,0,0,0,,Why, after all these years of loyalty,\Nwould he turn on his own family?
Dialogue: 0,0:14:27.23,0:14:29.85,Default,,0,0,0,,Bakura must have preyed\Nupon the hidden jealousy
Dialogue: 0,0:14:29.93,0:14:32.34,Default,,0,0,0,,of Narin always felt towards his brother.
Dialogue: 0,0:14:32.69,0:14:37.04,Default,,0,0,0,,And the incredible guilt he must have\Nharbored after giving up his family.
Dialogue: 0,0:14:39.89,0:14:44.59,Default,,0,0,0,,Sato, my boy, no longer shall we\Nlive in the shadow of my brother!
Dialogue: 0,0:14:45.11,0:14:50.89,Default,,0,0,0,,The time has come to rise up and claim\Nour rightful place on the throne of Egypt!
Dialogue: 0,0:14:50.97,0:14:53.07,Default,,0,0,0,,Heed my words!
Dialogue: 0,0:14:53.47,0:14:55.23,Default,,0,0,0,,The era of King Seto!
Dialogue: 0,0:14:55.39,0:14:56.35,Default,,0,0,0,,I strayed down!
Dialogue: 0,0:15:01.15,0:15:02.45,Default,,0,0,0,,Farewell, Pharaoh!
Dialogue: 0,0:15:17.01,0:15:19.99,Default,,0,0,0,,Someone is deflecting the attack! But who?
Dialogue: 0,0:15:20.97,0:15:22.62,Default,,0,0,0,,This isn't part of the game?
Dialogue: 0,0:15:22.89,0:15:24.45,Default,,0,0,0,,Who has interfered?
Dialogue: 0,0:15:25.53,0:15:26.83,Default,,0,0,0,,Did you forget?
Dialogue: 0,0:15:27.23,0:15:31.65,Default,,0,0,0,,There are two people playing this\Ngame, and I have a token as well.
Dialogue: 0,0:15:32.33,0:15:33.68,Default,,0,0,0,,Where did you get that?
Dialogue: 0,0:15:36.15,0:15:39.49,Default,,0,0,0,,Who dares stand in the way of my destiny?
Dialogue: 0,0:15:39.57,0:15:40.67,Default,,0,0,0,,Identify yourself!
Dialogue: 0,0:15:41.21,0:15:44.57,Default,,0,0,0,,I am Hassan, protector of the pharaohs.
Dialogue: 0,0:15:44.85,0:15:48.23,Default,,0,0,0,,For centuries I have defended\Nthe honor of Egypt's kings.
Dialogue: 0,0:15:48.99,0:15:50.58,Default,,0,0,0,,So fear not, your highness.
Dialogue: 0,0:15:50.77,0:15:52.95,Default,,0,0,0,,I shall shield you from the darkness.
Dialogue: 0,0:15:53.27,0:15:57.01,Default,,0,0,0,,Just as I shielded your\Nfather and his father before.
Dialogue: 0,0:16:00.57,0:16:01.85,Default,,0,0,0,,Hello? Who's there?
Dialogue: 0,0:16:02.75,0:16:06.11,Default,,0,0,0,,I have come to warn you of\Nan impending danger, Pharaoh.
Dialogue: 0,0:16:06.85,0:16:09.13,Default,,0,0,0,,Zork the Dark One will soon awaken.
Dialogue: 0,0:16:11.47,0:16:12.65,Default,,0,0,0,,I remember him.
Dialogue: 0,0:16:12.87,0:16:15.33,Default,,0,0,0,,He came to me in a vision\Nwhen I was stranded.
Dialogue: 0,0:16:15.41,0:16:17.70,Default,,0,0,0,,But I thought I was just hallucinating.
Dialogue: 0,0:16:18.23,0:16:21.69,Default,,0,0,0,,If you truly are the\Nprotector of the pharaoh,
Dialogue: 0,0:16:21.93,0:16:24.75,Default,,0,0,0,,then you should be\Nprotecting my son, Seto,
Dialogue: 0,0:16:24.99,0:16:29.65,Default,,0,0,0,,for he is the true king of Egypt, not\Nthat imposter cowering behind you.
Dialogue: 0,0:16:30.47,0:16:32.19,Default,,0,0,0,,Darkness be gone!
Dialogue: 0,0:16:34.99,0:16:35.82,Default,,0,0,0,,No!
Dialogue: 0,0:16:42.51,0:16:44.73,Default,,0,0,0,,My time freezing hourglass!
Dialogue: 0,0:16:45.97,0:16:48.97,Default,,0,0,0,,Oh, well, it seems time marches on.
Dialogue: 0,0:16:49.33,0:16:51.45,Default,,0,0,0,,My friends are now free!
Dialogue: 0,0:16:53.51,0:16:54.97,Default,,0,0,0,,I can move!
Dialogue: 0,0:16:55.57,0:16:56.40,Default,,0,0,0,,What?
Dialogue: 0,0:16:56.48,0:16:58.55,Default,,0,0,0,,But I rendered those fools immovable!
Dialogue: 0,0:16:58.87,0:17:01.22,Default,,0,0,0,,They were prisoners in their own bodies!
Dialogue: 0,0:17:02.43,0:17:03.26,Default,,0,0,0,,Not anymore.
Dialogue: 0,0:17:03.34,0:17:05.53,Default,,0,0,0,,Your shadow spell has been broken!
Dialogue: 0,0:17:07.57,0:17:11.97,Default,,0,0,0,,It's only a matter of time before the\Nshadows claim your spirit, Pharaoh!
Dialogue: 0,0:17:12.05,0:17:15.41,Default,,0,0,0,,Oh, and everything you've\Never cared about crumbles.
Dialogue: 0,0:17:16.01,0:17:19.07,Default,,0,0,0,,Your poor friends are\Nall running out of steam.
Dialogue: 0,0:17:19.93,0:17:21.43,Default,,0,0,0,,What? But how?
Dialogue: 0,0:17:22.17,0:17:26.76,Default,,0,0,0,,Attached to everyone's dual discs is a\Nsensor that measures their life energy.
Dialogue: 0,0:17:27.15,0:17:30.13,Default,,0,0,0,,My great shadow Magus is at full power.
Dialogue: 0,0:17:30.53,0:17:33.65,Default,,0,0,0,,But the same cannot be\Nset for your friends.
Dialogue: 0,0:17:37.19,0:17:40.99,Default,,0,0,0,,I'm afraid once an individual's\Nlife force sensor goes dark,
Dialogue: 0,0:17:41.07,0:17:44.61,Default,,0,0,0,,The spirit is banished to the\NShadow Realm for all eternity.
Dialogue: 0,0:17:45.11,0:17:46.85,Default,,0,0,0,,That goes for you, too.
Dialogue: 0,0:17:47.25,0:17:50.55,Default,,0,0,0,,When you lose in the past,\Nyou lose here as well.
Dialogue: 0,0:17:52.21,0:17:53.17,Default,,0,0,0,,Now then,
Dialogue: 0,0:17:53.37,0:17:57.93,Default,,0,0,0,,are you beginning to understand the\Nbrilliance of this Shadow Game I've created?
Dialogue: 0,0:17:58.01,0:18:00.07,Default,,0,0,0,,You and I are the Game Masters,
Dialogue: 0,0:18:00.37,0:18:04.87,Default,,0,0,0,,manipulating the fate of people who\Nlived on this Earth 5,000 years ago.
Dialogue: 0,0:18:05.19,0:18:09.49,Default,,0,0,0,,At times, we're merely observing events\Nexactly as they were played out in the past.
Dialogue: 0,0:18:09.57,0:18:11.34,Default,,0,0,0,,Most other times we intervene,
Dialogue: 0,0:18:11.53,0:18:15.82,Default,,0,0,0,,manipulating certain actions in order\Nto change the outcome in our favor.
Dialogue: 0,0:18:16.07,0:18:17.25,Default,,0,0,0,,So you might say,
Dialogue: 0,0:18:17.49,0:18:19.73,Default,,0,0,0,,we're like two sides of the same coin,
Dialogue: 0,0:18:19.81,0:18:23.65,Default,,0,0,0,,and we're playing out the ultimate\Nbattle between light and shadows.
Dialogue: 0,0:18:23.73,0:18:25.69,Default,,0,0,0,,But Korra, this must end!
Dialogue: 0,0:18:26.27,0:18:29.49,Default,,0,0,0,,Of course, every game has an end, Farrell.
Dialogue: 0,0:18:29.99,0:18:32.61,Default,,0,0,0,,It's just a question of\Nwho the victor will be,
Dialogue: 0,0:18:32.69,0:18:35.81,Default,,0,0,0,,and who will spend eternity\Nroaming the Shadow Realm.
Dialogue: 0,0:18:35.99,0:18:38.59,Default,,0,0,0,,Now do you see why I called\Nthis the ultimate game?
Dialogue: 0,0:18:38.67,0:18:44.21,Default,,0,0,0,,Here we both sit, high above the rest of\Nthe world, deciding the future of mankind.
Dialogue: 0,0:18:44.87,0:18:47.87,Default,,0,0,0,,The fate of the world rests in our hands!
Dialogue: 0,0:18:51.35,0:18:52.23,Default,,0,0,0,,That's enough!
Dialogue: 0,0:18:52.59,0:18:56.59,Default,,0,0,0,,You may fight for greed, but I\Nfight for something else entirely.
Dialogue: 0,0:18:57.31,0:19:00.81,Default,,0,0,0,,The safety of my friends\Nand that of the world.
Dialogue: 0,0:19:01.19,0:19:03.63,Default,,0,0,0,,I defeated you once and I'll do it again!
Dialogue: 0,0:19:04.07,0:19:05.93,Default,,0,0,0,,That's all in the past, Pharah.
Dialogue: 0,0:19:06.01,0:19:07.81,Default,,0,0,0,,But here in this shadow game,
Dialogue: 0,0:19:08.07,0:19:11.71,Default,,0,0,0,,I have all sorts of advantages I\Ndidn't have in our first encounter.
Dialogue: 0,0:19:11.79,0:19:16.29,Default,,0,0,0,,And since your memory is sketchy at\Nbest, you'll never remember how you won.
Dialogue: 0,0:19:20.01,0:19:21.67,Default,,0,0,0,,I still have time.
Dialogue: 0,0:19:21.95,0:19:23.48,Default,,0,0,0,,That's where you're wrong.
Dialogue: 0,0:19:23.79,0:19:28.39,Default,,0,0,0,,Time is one luxury you don't have, for\Nthe countdown to destruction has begun.
